    <item>
      <title>Squeak 2.23.18</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 06:31:29 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>22318</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.23.18</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>html{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#18181b;background:transparent;margin:0;padding:4px 2px}ul{margin:0 0 10px;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 10px}h4{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#52525b;margin:16px 0 6px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08)}code{font:12px ui-monospace,'SF Mono',monospace;background:rgba(0,0,0,.06);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:6px}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#f4f4f5}h4{color:#a1a1aa;border-top-color:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}code{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}}</style></head><body><ul><li>Steering is smooth: your steer shows in the stream and the work carries on below it, nothing folds away.</li><li>Steps stay in time order around your steer: what happened before it above the card, what came after below.</li></ul><h4>Also in 2.23.17</h4><ul><li>After you pick an option, the agent's steps show live under your answer.</li></ul><h4>Also in 2.23.16</h4><ul><li>What you're typing stays put when the agent asks you to choose, and when you switch chats.</li><li>Stop really stops: the chat stops showing Working, and its background helpers show as stopped.</li><li>A chat keeps its work after Squeak restarts: each turn's thinking, commands and helpers stay, folded under the reply.</li><li>Pictures you attach show as pictures in older messages too.</li><li>In full screen, the window controls appear beside the sidebar controls when you move to the top, like Safari, instead of a separate bar.</li><li>Squeak uses far less CPU and battery: it fetches only what changed and redraws only what moved.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
